# Build and hosting

- This project is built with Create React App. Keep `package.json` and `package-lock.json` synchronized when changing dependencies.
- Create React App's `PUBLIC_URL` environment variable overrides `homepage`; keep them aligned when the public site domain changes, and verify generated `build/index.html` asset URLs.
- Files in `public/` are addressed by their public URL. Check asset paths when changing the hosting base URL.
- Preserve client-side routes (`/`, `/resume`, and `/credits`) when changing hosting configuration; direct navigation to each route must continue to work.
- Never add environment-specific secrets to tracked configuration or expose them in build output.
